<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-183] WikipediaXmlSplitter spits one chunk per line</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-183</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The Wikipedia XML splitter inner loop erronously detects end of the line-iterator which causes it to create chunks with just one line worth of page content instead of respecting the --chunkSize cli option.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Simple patch to fix this will follow.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
